                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "5.3 Scheduling algorithms. A scheduling algorithm decides which of the tasks in the ready queue is allocated the CPU. First come, first served is the simplest: the task that requests the CPU first is allocated it first.",
